config ODM_LTR2568
	bool "Lite-On LTR-2568 ALS/PS for MediaTek package (Doogee S88 Pro, from the disassembly)"
	default n
	help
	  Lite-On LTR-2568 ambient light and proximity sensor of the Doogee S88
	  Pro, reconstructed by reading the disassembled factory kernel. The
	  factory config turns it on (CONFIG_ODM_LTR2568=y) and no public tree has
	  the source: without this symbol `olddefconfig` discards the factory
	  config line in silence and the driver never enters the kernel. See
	  docs/bringup/driver-riscritti.md.
